       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      *****************************************************************
      *  X25 - Simple game for bored AS400 users                      *
      *---------------------------------------------------------------*
      *  COMPILER:  Cobol/400                                         *
      *                                                               *
      *  AUTHOR:    Ales Linda   (e-mail: linda@its.cz)               *
      *                                                               *
      *  DESCR.:    Numbers 1 to 24 are shuffled in 5x5 table on      *
      *             the screen, Player can move them using numeric    *
      *             keys 1,2,3,5. The goal is to sort them into       *
      *             right order. You can use SPACE key or Enter in    *
      *             the case when your boss is coming.                *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. X25.
       AUTHOR. ALES LINDA.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT WS ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-X25W
                 ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                 ACCESS  MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                 CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  WS.
       01  WS-REC PIC X(1800).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  X25W01-O-FORMAT.
           COPY DDS-X25W01-O OF X25W.
       01  WS-REC01 REDEFINES X25W01-O-FORMAT.
           03 WS-VOLBA     PIC X.
           03 WS-TABLE1.
              05 WS-ROW OCCURS 5.
                 07 WS-CHAR  OCCURS 5  PIC XX.
           03 WS-MSG    PIC X(75).
       01  X25W01-I-FORMAT.
           COPY DDS-X25W01-I OF X25W.
       01  X25W02-O-FORMAT.
           COPY DDS-X25W02-O OF X25W.
       01  X25W02-I-FORMAT.
           COPY DDS-X25W02-I OF X25W.

       01  INDICATOR-AREA.
           05 IN03        PIC 1 INDIC 03.
              88 CMD3         VALUE B"1".
           05 IN05        PIC 1 INDIC 05.
              88 CMD5         VALUE B"1".
           05 IN12        PIC 1 INDIC 12.
              88 CMD12        VALUE B"1".
       01  WS-CONTROL.
           05 BEF-TASTEN           PIC XX.
              88 DOPR              VALUE "05".
           05 WKST-ID              PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05 REC-FMT              PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       77  X           PIC S99.
       77  Y           PIC S99.
       77  R           PIC S99.
       77  S           PIC S99.
       77  P           PIC S99.
       77  ZPRAVA      PIC 9.
       77  SHOW        PIC 9.
       77  POMER1      PIC S999V9999.
       77  POMER2      PIC S999V9999.
       01  POMER3      PIC S999V9999.
       01  POMER3R REDEFINES POMER3.
           03  FILLER   PIC X(6).
           03  CISLO    PIC 9.
       01  TIM.
           03 TIM-HH    PIC 99.
           03 TIM-MM    PIC 99.
           03 TIM-SS    PIC 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN SECTION.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O WS.
           PERFORM FILL-FIELDS.
       LOOP.
           MOVE SPACE TO VOLBA OF X25W01-O.
           MOVE SPACE TO WS-CHAR(R S).
           PERFORM COMPARE.
           PERFORM WR-SCREEN.
           IF CMD3 OR CMD12 GO TO ENDING.
           IF CMD5 PERFORM FILL-FIELDS GO TO LOOP.
           IF VOLBA OF X25W01-O = " " PERFORM BOSS-KEY GO TO LOOP.
           IF VOLBA OF X25W01-O = "1" PERFORM MOV-LEFT GO TO LOOP.
           IF VOLBA OF X25W01-O = "3" PERFORM MOV-RIGHT GO TO LOOP.
           IF VOLBA OF X25W01-O = "2" PERFORM MOV-DOWN GO TO LOOP.
           IF VOLBA OF X25W01-O = "5" PERFORM MOV-UP GO TO LOOP.
           GO TO LOOP.
       ENDING.
           CLOSE WS.
           STOP RUN.
      * ===============================================================
       FILL-FIELDS SECTION.
       FF. INITIALIZE WS-REC01.
           MOVE ZERO TO ZPRAVA SHOW.
           MOVE "0102030405" TO WS-ROW(1).
           MOVE "0607080910" TO WS-ROW(2).
           MOVE "1112131415" TO WS-ROW(3).
           MOVE "1617181920" TO WS-ROW(4).
           MOVE "21222324  " TO WS-ROW(5).
           MOVE 5 TO R.
           MOVE 5 TO S.
           PERFORM SHUFFLING VARYING X FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL X > 20.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       MOV-LEFT SECTION.
       ML. IF S NOT = 5
                COMPUTE P = S + 1
                MOVE WS-CHAR(R P) TO WS-CHAR(R S)
                MOVE P TO S.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       MOV-RIGHT SECTION.
       MR. IF S NOT = 1
                COMPUTE P = S - 1
                MOVE WS-CHAR(R P) TO WS-CHAR(R S)
                MOVE P TO S.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       MOV-DOWN SECTION.
       MD. IF R NOT = 1
                COMPUTE P = R - 1
                MOVE WS-CHAR(P S) TO WS-CHAR(R S)
                MOVE P TO R.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       MOV-UP SECTION.
       MU. IF R NOT = 5
                COMPUTE P = R + 1
                MOVE WS-CHAR(P S) TO WS-CHAR(R S)
                MOVE P TO R.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       COMPARE SECTION.
       CMP.
           IF WS-ROW(1) NOT = "0102030405" GO TO CMP-EX.
           IF WS-ROW(2) NOT = "0607080910" GO TO CMP-EX.
           IF WS-ROW(3) NOT = "1112131415" GO TO CMP-EX.
           IF WS-ROW(4) NOT = "1617181920" GO TO CMP-EX.
           IF WS-ROW(5) NOT = "21222324  " GO TO CMP-EX.
           MOVE "OK - GOOD WORK - GAME OVER" TO WS-MSG.
       CMP-EX. EXIT.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       SHUFFLING SECTION.
       SH. MOVE ZERO TO Y.
           ACCEPT TIM FROM TIME.
       SH1.
           ADD 1 TO Y.
           IF Y > 79 GO TO SH-EX.
           COMPUTE POMER1 = (X + TIM-MM + TIM-SS + TIM-HH) / 13.
           COMPUTE POMER2 = (Y + TIM-MM + TIM-SS + TIM-HH) / 17.
           COMPUTE POMER3 = POMER1 / POMER2.
           IF CISLO < 3 PERFORM MOV-LEFT.
           IF CISLO = 3 OR 4 PERFORM MOV-RIGHT.
           IF CISLO = 5 OR 6 PERFORM MOV-DOWN.
           IF CISLO > 6 PERFORM MOV-UP.
           MOVE SPACE TO WS-CHAR(R S).
           GO TO SH1.
       SH-EX. EXIT.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       WR-SCREEN SECTION.
       WRITE-OBR.
           WRITE WS-REC FROM X25W01-O-FORMAT FORMAT IS "X25W01".
       READ-OBR.
           READ WS INTO X25W01-I-FORMAT.
           MOVE CORR X25W01-I-INDIC TO INDICATOR-AREA.
           MOVE CORR X25W01-I TO X25W01-O.
      * ---------------------------------------------------------------
       BOSS-KEY SECTION.
       WRITE-OB2.
           WRITE WS-REC FROM X25W02-O-FORMAT FORMAT IS "X25W02".
           READ WS INTO X25W02-I-FORMAT.
           MOVE CORR X25W02-I-INDIC TO INDICATOR-AREA.
           IF CMD3 OR CMD12 GO TO ENDING.
      * ----End of source---------------------------------------------*
